              "text": "причём (prichyóm) — \"and what is more, moreover\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Он опоздал, причём уже в третий раз. On opozdál, prichyóm uzhé v trétiy raz. He was late, and what is more, for the third time."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "It adds a detail that sharpens what came before. Stress on the second syllable."
            }
